; Sample personal ledger — USD and Bitcoin
; Accounts follow the convention: assets, liabilities, income, expenses, equity

commodity $1,000.00
commodity 1.00000000 BTC

; Market prices for BTC in USD
P 2026-01-01 BTC $95,000
P 2026-02-01 BTC $98,000
P 2026-03-01 BTC $92,000
P 2026-04-01 BTC $101,000
P 2026-05-01 BTC $108,000
P 2026-06-01 BTC $112,000
P 2026-07-01 BTC $110,000
P 2026-08-01 BTC $115,000

